OL,3,AChris Mason: Why Andy Burnham's
OL,4,Aabout-turn on Manchester City matters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rows circulating around Manchester
OL,7,FCity are huge, and they are only going
OL,8,Fto get bigger.
OL,10,FThe Premier League has concluded that
OL,11,FCity "systematically broke Premier
OL,12,FLeague Rules for nearly a decade".
OL,14,FThis, clearly, matters for the club,
OL,15,Fbut that is just the start of it.
